      "promptEs": "4chan y la cultura de imágenes en Internet",
      "questionEn": "Why does the title text thank 4chan in a joke about stored funny images?",
      "answerEn": "4chan is an anonymous online discussion site built around posted images, and it helped popularize many internet memes—images or jokes that people repeatedly copy and remix. The joke treats a large saved collection of funny images as newly valuable wealth.",
      "noteEn": "This cultural reference explains why the title text imagines a 4chan user becoming successful when image collections become the basis of monetary worth.",
